  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Baseline tokens</h3>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>Use the table's menu to select a token set. The baseline extended FAB token sets are organized by common tokens, then by surface and branded color styles. Other color styles like primary, secondary, and tertiary are still used by the latest extended FABs.</p>"
  },
