  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Baseline states</h3><p>States are visual representations used to communicate the status of a component or interactive element. <a href=\"/m3/pages/interaction-states\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more about interaction states</a></p>"
  },
